  "translation": "Turun kelen tilenni ye kogo tan ni segin ye, a sanfɛda fana ye nɛgɛ ye, sanfɛda tilenni ye kogo saba ye; ni ɲɛgɛnjɛ ni anadidow sanfɛda kan tilancogo, nɛgɛ bɛɛ de ye; turun filanan fana ye o cogo, ɲɛgɛnjɛ ye.",
